    "text": "goes to @dalbhat.berlin📍Berlin Wilmersdorf, Mainzer Straße 8\n\nDalbhat is a charming little restaurant that offers a selection of Nepalese specialties 👏\n\nOf course, the handmade momos are a must-try! They tasted delicious with the soybean and peanut sauce. We also loved the other dishes, such as the vegan appetizer platter with its diverse flavors, the pork belly and the dessert, a lovely, light way to end the meal: a carrot-based pastry with matcha cream 😍\n\n#berlinberlin #berlin #foodfood #foodberlin #berlinfood",
